  "Does adverse impact alone, with zero attribution evidence, ever justify even a narrow Tier 0 procedural floor — or does it require some minimal grounding first to prevent manufactured standing?": "在完全没有归属证据的情况下,纯粹的不利影响是否足以正当化哪怕是最窄的第零层进程底线?还是必须先有某种最低限度的基础,才能防止有人凭空取得进程地位?",
  "Does the complaint, as filed, actually contain a Count I direct-act theory for Amodei that this round's reading missed -- or would establishing his liability under that count require amendment, or a legal theory the pleading doesn't yet state?": "诉状本文里，究竟有没有一套这一轮核对时漏看的、把 Amodei 纳入第一项诉因的直接行为理论——还是要成立他在这项诉因下的责任，需要修正诉状，或需要一套诉状目前还没写出来的法律理论？",
