  "Playground: three new tools — signed license token demo (HMAC-SHA256 in-browser: sign, verify, tamper detection, expiry), HTTP 402 response builder wired to the live endpoint, and a crawler policy tester that validates fetched files against the draft schemas.": "实验工具:新增三个工具——签名许可令牌演示(浏览器内 HMAC-SHA256:签名、验证、篡改检测、过期)、接入在线端点的 HTTP 402 响应构建器,以及按草案 schema 验证所抓取文件的爬虫政策测试器。",
  "Playground: working AICR generator, AICL generator, and schema validator (in-browser, ajv, draft 2020-12).": "实验工具:可用的 AICR 生成器、AICL 生成器与 schema 验证器(浏览器内运行,ajv,draft 2020-12)。",
